{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43314","headline":"西戎即叙 · 李子昂","name":"西戎即叙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悬首藁街中，天兵破犬戎。\n营收低陇月，旗偃度湟风。\n肃杀三边劲，萧条万里空。\n元戎咸服罪，余孽尽输忠。\n圣理符轩化，仁恩契禹功。\n降逾洞庭险，枭拟郅支穷。\n已散军容捷，还资庙算通。\n今朝观即叙，非与献獒同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}